# Stops every I2C device that has wake enabled (on the Framework 16 that is the touchpad, PIXA3854) from waking the laptop
# from sleep; see docs/framework16-sleep.md. The attribute test makes repeated events a no-op.
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="i2c", ATTR{power/wakeup}=="enabled", ATTR{power/wakeup}="disabled"
